      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ELECTRA SHARK (2) did a good job to come from a wide barrier for fourth on debut at Wagga, beaten 2.5 metres. Should be improved by that experience and is much better served by this barrier.  INTIMATE DANGER (3) is racing well. Broke the maiden two back at Goulburn then came from the back row when runner-up here six days ago. Big chance from a good draw. HIDDEN RESORT (1) is a two-year-old filly from the Hunt stable on debut. Has a trial win at Menangle under the belt and should enjoy an economical run from this draw. Look for a strong start to her career. ZEE SEVEN ONE (9) is another on debut and while the draw is tricky he has shown enough at the trials to be competitive.",
